<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') -%>

<body>

<div class="container my-5">
  <h2 class="text-center mb-4">Rules & Guidelines</h2>

  <p class="text-center text-muted">
    These rules and guidelines are designed to ensure a safe and smooth experience for all users of the platform.
  </p>

  <hr>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>1. General Rules</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Users must provide accurate and genuine information.</li>
      <li>Misuse of the platform is strictly prohibited.</li>
      <li>Any suspicious activity may lead to account suspension.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>2. Event Participation Rules</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Participants must register before the deadline.</li>
      <li>Follow instructions given by the event organizer.</li>
      <li>Maintain discipline during events.</li>
      <li>Cheating or misconduct is not allowed.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>3. Content Guidelines</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>No offensive or inappropriate content.</li>
      <li>Event details must be clear and relevant.</li>
      <li>Fake or misleading information is prohibited.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>4. Review Guidelines</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Reviews should be honest and respectful.</li>
      <li>Avoid spam or irrelevant comments.</li>
      <li>No abusive language allowed.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>5. Organizer Responsibilities</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide correct event details.</li>
      <li>Ensure smooth execution of events.</li>
      <li>Respond to participant queries.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>6. Account & Security</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Users are responsible for their accounts.</li>
      <li>Do not share login credentials.</li>
      <li>Report unauthorized access immediately.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>7. Platform Rights</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>The platform can remove any content without notice.</li>
      <li>Accounts violating rules may be suspended.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <p class="text-center fw-bold">
    By using this platform, you agree to follow all the above rules and guidelines.
  </p>

  <div class="text-center mt-4">
    <a href="/events" class="btn btn-dark">Back to Events</a>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>